## Usage

This is an Angular single-page app scaffolded with standalone components and the Angular
CLI. `npm install` runs automatically when the devcontainer is created.

```console
$ npm start                 # ng serve — dev server on http://localhost:4200
$ npm run build             # production build into dist/{{ app_name }}/
$ npx ng generate component features/foo
```

## Development

```console
$ npm test -- --watch=false # Karma/Jasmine unit tests (headless Chromium), single run
$ npm run lint              # ESLint over src/
```

`npm test` on its own stays in watch mode. The pre-commit hook runs `npm run lint` and the
test suite once against headless Chromium before a commit is accepted.
